{"chunk_id": "b0caca44526d", "area": "event_area", "context_heading": "AI PC 产业链动态", "date_hint": "2024年10月9日", "text": "根据国际数据公司IDC最新一期《全球季度个人计算设备跟踪》，2024年第三季度全球传统PC出货量同比下降2.4%，达到6880万台。苹果PC出货量为530万台，较去年同期的700万台大幅下降了24.2%，市场份额也从10%降到了7.8%，与华硕并列第四。", "image_only": false, "classification": {"chunk_id": "b0caca44526d", "label": "pure_event", "confidence": 0.5, "ontology_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from LLM response", "is_fallback": true}, "final_bucket": "pure_event", "used_fallback": true}
